<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Cricket-Prime Minister's XI v Windies scoreboard.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Cricket-Prime Minister's XI v Windies scoreboard.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard in the limited overs match between an Australian Prime Minister's XI and West Indies at Manuka Oval on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Prime Minister's XI  M.Hayden c McLean b Adams		  45</p>
<p> D.Hills st Murray b Adams		  52</p>
<p> M.DiVenuto run out			   25</p>
<p> A.Symonds run out			    33</p>
<p> I.Harvey not out			     55</p>
<p> A.Gilchrist b Bishop			  3</p>
<p> A.Border c Lara b McLean		    2</p>
<p> A.Stuart b Walsh				0</p>
<p> S.MacGill lbw b Walsh			 0</p>
<p> B.Young not out				 7</p>
<p> Extras (lb-11 w-13 nb-12)		  36</p>
<p> Total (for eight wickets, 50 overs)   258</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-113, 2-131, 3-175, 4-186, 5-197, 6-204, 7-218, 8-218.</p>
<p>Bowling: Bishop 9-1-45-1 (w-6 nb-1), McLean 9-1-50-1 (w-3), Walsh 10-2-48-2, Thompson 8-0-44-0 (w-2 nb-5), Adams 10-2-39-2, Holder 4-0-21-0 (w-2).</p>
<p>Note - West Indies bowled six no-balls, each worth two runs</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373 1800</p>
